### ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
### ║  PhysioSense Core API — Guía de Endpoints                  ║
### ║  Base URL: http://localhost:3000/api/v1                    ║
### ║  Auth: Bearer Token (JWT)                                  ║
### ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

@host = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@baseUrl = {{host}}
@token = TU_ACCESS_TOKEN_AQUI
@patientId = 1
@sessionId = 1
@exerciseRef = EX-001
@therapistId = 1
@recordId = 1
@assessmentId = 1
@planId = 1
@sessionExerciseId = 1

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Todos los endpoints requieren:
###   Authorization: Bearer <access_token>
###
### El access_token se obtiene del microservicio de autenticación
### y dura 15 minutos.
###
### Roles:
###   - PHYSIOTHERAPIST (FIS) → fisioterapeuta
###   - PATIENT (PAC)        → paciente
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 🩺 PACIENTES
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Listar todos los pacientes (FIS ve todos, PAC ve solo su ficha)
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener pacientes asignados al fisioterapeuta autenticado
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener detalle de un paciente
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients/{{patientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear ficha clínica de paciente
POST {{baseUrl}}/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 100,
  "firstName": "Juan",
  "lastName": "Pérez",
  "birthDate": "1985-03-15",
  "gender": "M",
  "phone": "+52 555 123 4567",
  "email": "juan.perez@email.com",
  "address": "Calle Falsa 123, CDMX",
  "diagnosis": "Lumbalgia crónica",
  "medicalHistory": "Cirugía lumbar 2020",
  "currentMedication": "Ibuprofeno 400mg",
  "therapistId": {{therapistId}}
}

### Actualizar parcialmente la ficha clínica
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/patients/{{patientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+52 555 987 6543",
  "currentMedication": "Paracetamol 500mg"
}

### Asignar fisioterapeuta a cargo
PUT {{baseUrl}}/patients/{{patientId}}/therapist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "therapistId": {{therapistId}}
}

### Obtener fisioterapeutas asignados al paciente
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients/{{patientId}}/therapist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dar de baja un paciente (baja lógica)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/patients/{{patientId}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reactivar un paciente dado de baja
PUT {{baseUrl}}/patients/{{patientId}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Eliminar ficha clínica (uso administrativo)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/patients/{{patientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 🏋️ EJERCICIOS
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Listar catálogo de ejercicios
GET {{baseUrl}}/exercises
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener categorías disponibles
GET {{baseUrl}}/exercises/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener ejercicio por código estable
GET {{baseUrl}}/exercises/code/EX-001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener ejercicio por código o ID numérico
GET {{baseUrl}}/exercises/{{exerciseRef}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear un ejercicio
POST {{baseUrl}}/exercises
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "EX-001",
  "name": "Flexión de rodilla",
  "description": "Flexión activa de rodilla en decúbito supino",
  "category": "FORTALECIMIENTO",
  "bodyRegion": "RODILLA",
  "difficulty": "BASICO",
  "targetReps": 15,
  "targetSets": 3,
  "durationSeconds": 60,
  "instructions": "Acostado boca arriba, flexionar la rodilla lentamente",
  "contraindications": "Dolor agudo, inflamación activa"
}

### Actualizar un ejercicio
PUT {{baseUrl}}/exercises/{{exerciseRef}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Flexión de rodilla modificada",
  "targetReps": 20
}

### Dar de baja un ejercicio (baja lógica)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/exercises/{{exerciseRef}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Subir video de ejercicio (máx 100 MB)
POST {{baseUrl}}/exercises/media/video
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="exerciseRef"

{{exerciseRef}}
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="video.mp4"
Content-Type: video/mp4

< ./video.mp4
--WebAppBoundary--

### Subir imagen de portada (máx 5 MB)
POST {{baseUrl}}/exercises/media/image
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="exerciseRef"

{{exerciseRef}}
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="imagen.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./imagen.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 📅 SESIONES
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Listar sesiones (FIS ve todas, PAC ve las suyas)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener sesiones del paciente autenticado
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener detalle de una sesión
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear una sesión de tratamiento
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": {{patientId}},
  "exerciseRef": "{{exerciseRef}}",
  "scheduledDate": "2026-10-15T10:00:00.000Z",
  "notes": "Sesión de fortalecimiento"
}

### Actualizar una sesión
PUT {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "Sesión actualizada",
  "scheduledDate": "2026-10-16T14:00:00.000Z"
}

### Arrancar ejecución de sesión (PAC)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Completar sesión (recalcula progreso)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancelar sesión
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ── Planes de tratamiento ──

### Obtener planes de tratamiento de un paciente
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/plans/{{patientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener plan activo de un paciente
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/plans/{{patientId}}/active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear plan de tratamiento
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/plans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": {{patientId}},
  "name": "Plan de rehabilitación lumbar",
  "description": "Plan de 4 semanas para fortalecimiento lumbar",
  "startDate": "2026-10-12",
  "endDate": "2026-11-09",
  "exercises": [
    { "exerciseRef": "EX-001", "sets": 3, "reps": 15, "restSeconds": 60 },
    { "exerciseRef": "EX-002", "sets": 3, "reps": 12, "restSeconds": 45 }
  ]
}

### Dar de baja un plan de tratamiento
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/sessions/plans/{{planId}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 📊 TELEMETRÍA
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Ingesta de lote de repeticiones (idempotente)
POST {{baseUrl}}/telemetry
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionExerciseId": {{sessionExerciseId}},
  "repetitions": [
    { "serie": 1, "repNumber": 1, "angle": 45.2, "force": 12.5, "timestamp": "2026-10-12T10:00:01.000Z" },
    { "serie": 1, "repNumber": 2, "angle": 47.8, "force": 13.1, "timestamp": "2026-10-12T10:00:03.000Z" },
    { "serie": 1, "repNumber": 3, "angle": 44.5, "force": 11.9, "timestamp": "2026-10-12T10:00:05.000Z" }
  ]
}

### Obtener repeticiones de un ejercicio
GET {{baseUrl}}/telemetry/{{sessionExerciseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener resumen de ejecución de un ejercicio
GET {{baseUrl}}/telemetry/{{sessionExerciseId}}/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 📈 PROGRESO
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Obtener ventana de progreso (gráficos)
GET {{baseUrl}}/progress/{{patientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener múltiples ventanas (carrusel de la app)
GET {{baseUrl}}/progress/{{patientId}}/windows
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener historial de sesiones del paciente
GET {{baseUrl}}/progress/{{patientId}}/records
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detalle de una sesión para pantalla de progreso
GET {{baseUrl}}/progress/{{patientId}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener snapshots agregados
GET {{baseUrl}}/progress/{{patientId}}/snapshots
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Materializar snapshot de la ventana actual
POST {{baseUrl}}/progress/{{patientId}}/snapshots
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 🩺 CLÍNICO (Historial y Evaluaciones)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Obtener historial clínico del paciente
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients/{{patientId}}/records
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener detalle de una nota clínica
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients/{{patientId}}/records/{{recordId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Agregar nota al historial clínico
POST {{baseUrl}}/patients/{{patientId}}/records
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "note": "El paciente muestra mejora en rango de movimiento",
  "type": "EVOLUCION"
}

### Eliminar una nota clínica
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/patients/{{patientId}}/records/{{recordId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ── Evaluaciones ──

### Obtener evaluaciones del paciente
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients/{{patientId}}/assessments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener contador de evaluaciones pendientes
GET {{baseUrl}}/assessments/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener detalle de una evaluación
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients/{{patientId}}/assessments/{{assessmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Registrar evaluación clínica
POST {{baseUrl}}/patients/{{patientId}}/assessments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "INICIAL",
  "painLevel": 6,
  "mobilityScore": 45,
  "strengthScore": 30,
  "notes": "Evaluación inicial post-cirugía"
}

### Marcar evaluación como completada
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/patients/{{patientId}}/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 👨‍⚕️ FISIOTERAPEUTAS
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Obtener perfil del fisioterapeuta autenticado
GET {{baseUrl}}/therapists/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener pacientes asignados al fisioterapeuta
GET {{baseUrl}}/therapists/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener detalle de un fisioterapeuta
GET {{baseUrl}}/therapists/{{therapistId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 📋 NOTAS IMPORTANTES
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# 1. El servidor corre con: npm run start:dev
#    Puerto: 3000 (configurable vía PORT en .env)
#
# 2. Todos los endpoints requieren:
#      Authorization: Bearer <access_token>
#
# 3. El access_token se obtiene del microservicio de autenticación
#    y dura 15 minutos.
#
# 4. Roles:
#      - PHYSIOTHERAPIST → acceso completo a pacientes, ejercicios, sesiones
#      - PATIENT        → acceso solo a sus propios datos
#
# 5. Validación estricta: el servidor rechaza campos no definidos en los DTOs.
#
# 6. Baja lógica: pacientes y ejercicios se desactivan, no se borran.
#
# 7. Telemetría idempotente: no duplica repeticiones con misma clave
#    (session_exercise, serie, repetición).
#
# 8. Swagger UI disponible en: http://localhost:3000/api
#
# 9. Archivos estáticos (media) en: http://localhost:3000/media/
#
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
